 [Mobile Sensors Demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/4.2-31d1c0c/mobile/sensors) doesn't work on Godot v4.4.dev4.official Android, but works fine on Godot v4.3.stable.\nThese functions in particular returns Vector3.ZERO on android 14:\n```\nvar acc = Input.get_accelerometer()\nvar grav = Input.get_gravity()\nvar mag = Input.get_magnetometer()\nvar gyro = Input.get_gyroscope()\n```\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUsing Godot v4.4.dev4.official, download [Mobile Sensors Demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/4.2-31d1c0c/mobile/sensors) project. Run the demo on an android device, then you will notice all 'Input' function return zero.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n Run [Mobile Sensors Demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/4.2-31d1c0c/mobile/sensors).","closed_by":{"login":"TheOathMan","id":57967535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3OTY3NTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57967535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan","html_url":"https://github.com/TheOathMan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheOathMan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99643/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":